<Base title="About" description="Who I am when I'm not at work.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p>
		I'm Levi Orero. By day I work on survey and evaluation research in East Africa and run <a
			href={LINKS.wrangla360}>Wrangla360</a
		>. This site is for everything else.
	</p>
	<p>
		I'm based in Kenya. When I'm not working, I'm usually reading a book or watching a documentary,
		and I write fiction and poetry of my own.
	</p>
	<p>
		My work writing only shows one side of me. This blog is where I share the rest: the stories, the
		side projects, the rabbit holes, and whatever has my attention that week.
	</p>
	<h2>Books</h2>
	<p>I publish fiction and poetry as Alfred Orero:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><em>By Fate and Blood</em>: a contemporary romance</li>
		<li><em>Visions From My Mother</em> (Century Poems, Book 1)</li>
		<li><em>The Universe Lives In Me</em> (Century Poems, Book 2)</li>
		<li><em>Show Me Genius</em> (Century Poems, Book 3)</li>
	</ul>
	<p>All of them are on my <a href={LINKS.books}>Amazon author page</a>.</p>
